{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>付款維修之前，先確認產品是否仍在保養期內，正是 Warranty Deadline Tracker 的用途。它適合擁有較多電子產品或家電的用戶，以購買日期推算保養到期日。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，實際保養範圍依製造商或賣家條款而定。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-140.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>記錄保養期限與到期提醒</h2>\n<p>輸入購買日期與保養年期，即可查看預計到期日及剩餘時間，付費維修前先確認是否仍在保養期內。程式可同時追蹤多件產品，並為每件產品設定提醒天數與通知時間，方便及早安排檢查或續保。實際保養範圍須依製造商或賣家的條款而定，提醒功能亦需開啟通知權限。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-81-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-82-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-83-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-418-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-85-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Warranty Deadline Tracker</li><li>應用類別：Shopping</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/warranty-deadline-tracker/id6804757195?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T03:45:54.285029+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T03:36:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:59:48.895364+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T03:38:32.103361+00:00","content_hash":"501fcb0b08330444409cce9917e403882fb806d132e4e7eae9c34ccddd82606e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}